"Meat.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/3/37/Meat..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210122090428\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/3/37/Meat..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210122090428 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/3/37/Meat..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210122090428 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Meat.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Meat..png\" data-image-name=\"Meat..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_4\" title=\"Series 4\">4</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hugh_Dennis\" title=\"Hugh Dennis\">Hugh Dennis</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Friendship_is_truth.\" title=\"Friendship is truth.\">Friendship is truth.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spatchcock_it.\" title=\"Spatchcock it.\">Spatchcock it.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Meat.</b></i> is the fifth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_4\" title=\"Series 4\">Series 4</a> of <i>Taskmaster</i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 23 May 2017. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Hugh_Dennis\" title=\"Hugh Dennis\">Hugh Dennis</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Meat.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Meat\" was what <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> suggested that his and Alex's fictional company exported, as they roleplayed what people's reactions might be to the contestants' attempts at the <a href=\"/wiki/Throw_something_into_something\" title=\"Throw something into something\">Throw something into something</a> task. The slide in the title card references the <a href=\"/wiki/Slide_the_furthest\" title=\"Slide the furthest\">Slide the furthest</a> task, despite no one using a slide at any point in the task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Meat.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Kød', which translates as 'Meat'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Liha', which translates as 'Meat'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Kjøtt', which translates as 'Meat'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title. <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Meat.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Hugh_Dennis\" title=\"Hugh Dennis\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Hugh Dennis</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Lycett\" title=\"Joe Lycett\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Joe Lycett</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Lolly_Adefope\" title=\"Lolly Adefope\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Lolly Adefope</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mel_Giedroyc\" title=\"Mel Giedroyc\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mel Giedroyc</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Noel_Fielding\" title=\"Noel Fielding\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Noel Fielding</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Cutest_thing\" title=\"Cutest thing\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Cutest thing.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Slide_the_furthest\" title=\"Slide the furthest\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Slide the furthest.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"tmtablerow\"><a href=\"/wiki/Put_on_the_wetsuit,_flippers,_face_mask_and_snorkel\" title=\"Put on the wetsuit, flippers, face mask and snorkel\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Maintaining constant eye contact and making continuous small talk with this Swedish person, put on the wetsuit, flippers, face mask and snorkel. Your head may not leave the Swedish person's frame at any point. You may not move the laptop from its current position.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><small><i><b>Bonus:</b> Whoever puts the wetsuit on best.</i></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><small><i><b>Bonus:</b> Best small talk.</i></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/Put_as_many_different_things_in_the_bathtub/Seal_the_top_of_this_bathtub_with_cling_film\" title=\"Put as many different things in the bathtub/Seal the top of this bathtub with cling film\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Put as many different things in the bathtub.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>0\n</